{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1126863-dark-heroes","id":1126863,"title":"Dark Heroes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-09T15:48:07-07:00","id":1126863,"title":"Dark Heroes","content":"This is related to a post i previously made on here, but i wondered if anyone here have used the Dark Hero template in one of their campaigns. Regular or mirrors it does not matter much, but i just wondered if anyone have seen how they balance out with the rest of the Chronicles of Darkness splats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T17:21:05-07:00","id":1126896,"title":"","content":"I did. The group I had was one quite D&amp;D oriented, never played Onyx Path, and to make the transition easier we went for a Dark Horror/Fantasy game rather than a straight CoD one. It was the 1001 Nights game I mention from time to time.<br /> <br /> So, how do they fare other supernaturals? While keeping in mind all of my players had some combat skills (some were the typical killer machines, others weren't but still could handle a lot), I'd say they handle things well. Arete makes them sturdy and the various powers can allow them to use tons of dices. They are not as flashy as other splats, but they bring a lot to the table just in sheer numbers and successes.<br /> <br /> They need some time to ramp up, though: at first they are at disadvantage against other splats but, once they begin to improve, the difference is way less harsh. Still, they're meant to replicate Dark Fantasy, so it's not like they can slay monsters left and right. All the confrontations, either mental or physical, were always a matter of painful attrition (just ask my players). Which is cool and appropriate if you ask me. They're basically uber-Hunters the way I see it, and they should act and prepare accordingly.<br /> <br /> As for the specific splats, it all depends on what we're talking about. I'm not good at white rooms scenarios, but generally speaking most not-crazy prepared monsters are feasible when the group has a considerable amount of experience on their sheets. Automatic successes and improved Willpower do a lot, when it comes down to sheer results","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 08-09-2017, 08:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T17:29:29-07:00","id":1126898,"title":"","content":"I used them in a superhero game, to great effect. You can model some pretty amazing things with them at higher exp levels, to include some insane numbers in combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":460,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","user":"Rani Neferet","date":". 08-09-2017, 08:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T17:36:28-07:00","id":1126900,"title":"","content":"Roll 17 dices and get 5 automatic success if you roll a single one. Good times, and not even the end of it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}